<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's Costello to attend APEC meeting.</title>
<headline>Australia's Costello to attend APEC meeting.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello would attend the Asia-Pacific Economic Co-operation (APEC) group finance ministers' meeting in the Philippines on April 5-6, his office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>While in Cebu to discuss current macroeconomic issues and challenges facing the region, Costello would also talk with treasurers and finance ministers from several APEC economies, his office said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
